          "quotedPost": null,
          "retweetedPost": {
            "id": "2119826242572828948",
            "text": "Los Angeles has never been a place that dreams small. But for too long, our County government has moved too slowly, failed to meet the moment, and allowed bureaucracy to stand in the way of progress.\n  I fight everyday to reform our government because I believe the people of Los Angeles deserve better — a government that works for them, delivers real results, and is accountable to the people it serves.   \nThat’s why I’m running to become Los Angeles County’s first elected County Executive.\n This is a once-in-a-generation opportunity to build a government that finally meets the scale of our challenges and the ambition of our people. From making Los Angeles more affordable and ending homelessness, to protecting our communities and responding urgently to crises, we need bold, unified leadership that puts progress over politics and people over process. \n The future of Los Angeles is ours to write. I'm running because I'm ready to fight for it — and together, we're going to build it.",
            "url": "https://x.com/LindseyForLA/status/2119826242572828948",
            "lang": "en",
            "createdAt": "2026-11-09T16:15:35.000Z",
